[{"range": "A16:G21", "cells": [[{"value": "UI-BEDSIDE", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "界面提示", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "你怎样回应？", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安说完五月饮酒后，暂停等待玩家选择一个普通选项。选后播放我的问句和苟安对应回应，各项只计分一次；不要求自由输入、证据提交或二次确认。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "V04→UI-BEDSIDE；QA:[0,+1,0]；QB:[+1,0,0]；QC:[-1,-1,0]；顺序为信任/严谨/责任；各维维持0—10下限上限。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}], [{"value": "CH2-LY02-QA", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "我（选项／配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "你喝酒是在五月。那这趟粮是什么时候领的？", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "调查严谨度加1；不提前授予日期线索。 共用饮酒自述末尾同机位截图，配固定语音和独立字幕；不再重复播放文字对白。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "→CH2-LY02-RA；影片=CH2-V04A；仅所选分支播放。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}], [{"value": "CH2-LY02-RA", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安（配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "这些都有交接记录。我如今也不想争了。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "不说出领粮日期，继续否认赴魏。 共用饮酒自述末尾同机位截图，配固定语音和独立字幕；不再重复播放文字对白。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "→CH2-LY02-008；影片=CH2-V04A；仅所选分支播放。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}], [{"value": "CH2-LY02-QB", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "我（选项／配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "八十杖挨下来，伤还撑得住吗？", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "信任加1。 共用饮酒自述末尾同机位截图，配固定语音和独立字幕；不再重复播放文字对白。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "→CH2-LY02-RB；影片=CH2-V04B；仅所选分支播放。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}], [{"value": "CH2-LY02-RB", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安（配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "养些日子就好。你不必总挂着。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "继续否认赴魏。 共用饮酒自述末尾同机位截图，配固定语音和独立字幕；不再重复播放文字对白。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "→CH2-LY02-008；影片=CH2-V04B；仅所选分支播放。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}], [{"value": "CH2-LY02-QC", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "我（选项／配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "喝酒误了粮，你这顿打不算冤。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "信任减1，调查严谨度减1（沿用0分下限）。 共用饮酒自述末尾同机位截图，配固定语音和独立字幕；不再重复播放文字对白。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "→CH2-LY02-007；影片=CH2-V04C；仅所选分支播放。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}, {"range": "A15:G15", "cells": [[{"value": "CH2-LY02-005", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "永安那地方，五月不灌两口酒，江风能钻进骨头缝。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "LY-X04", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "本句视频播放完后，打开首次伤帐三选项；不再自动代我承认误粮。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "录入LY-X04（仅为本人五月饮酒口述）；CH2-V04→UI-BEDSIDE。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}, {"range": "A22:G22", "cells": [[{"value": "CH2-LY02-006", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "历史停用（不导入）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "那咱们确实是误了。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "已由首次伤帐普通三选项替代，保留旧文案备查，不播放、不计分。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "停用；不导入运行流程。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}, {"range": "A23:G23", "cells": [[{"value": "CH2-LY02-007", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安（配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "我认栽，没什么委屈，养好伤就行了。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "仅选“喝酒误了粮，你这顿打不算冤”后播放；沿用原角色语音，共用同机位截图。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "CH2-LY02-QC→CH2-LY02-007→CH2-LY02-008；影片=CH2-V04C。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}, {"range": "A24:G24", "cells": [[{"value": "CH2-LY02-008", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "苟安（配音）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "我没打算去魏国。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "三条回应均在此汇合，播放完后进入夜间查账；不再播放“那是我多心了”。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "CH2-V04-END→CH2-LY02-010（V05）；不发交接日期线索。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}, {"range": "A25:G25", "cells": [[{"value": "CH2-LY02-009", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "历史停用（不导入）", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "那是我多心了。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "已由首次伤帐普通三选项替代，保留旧文案备查，不播放、不计分。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#FFF8DC", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}, {"value": "停用；不导入运行流程。", "cell_styles": {"background_color": "#EAF3FF", "font_color": "#202A2C", "font_family": "Arial", "font_size": 11, "vertical_alignment": "top"}}]]}]